{
    "title": "Beautistics: Makeup Organizer",
    "description": "The best beauty app to order and track your collection, better than any spreadsheet.\r\n\r\nBeautistics is a nice and handy application created for you not only to track the expiration dates, your Project Pan progress, but to become your personal beauty manager. Your makeup, care products, perfume, all your collection is near at hand. The application remembers prices and other useful statistics, it helps to follow your budgets and saves your future purchases in a wish list. You\u2019ll be able to organize a routine with help of a smart beauty calendar: the application will remind you of planned procedures. It\u2019s only a part of all the Beautistics\u2019 features! \r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\r\n\u2022\tSmart suggestions to add your items quickly\r\n\u2022\tMakeup expiration dates\r\n\u2022\tBudget planning\r\n\u2022\tInventory statistics and usages\r\n\u2022\tAdvanced beauty statistics in your phone\r\n\u2022\tSmart reminders\r\n\u2022\tProject Pan special features\r\n\u2022\tCollection backup\r\n\u2022\tHandy beauty calendar\r\n\u2022\tOrganize the makeup bag by brands and types\r\n\u2022\tCreate a personal wish list\r\n\r\n\r\nCOSMETICS EXPIRATION DATES\r\nThere is no need to remember the dates of opening packages and cosmetics expiration dates. Beautistics will do it for you. It\u2019s enough to allow notifications, and the application will notify you about the products that are expiring soon or already expired\r\n\r\nBUDGET PLANNING \r\nPlan your purchases with a help of Beautistics' special function. You can set your monthly, quarterly and yearly budget. If you are close to that limits or reach it, Beautistics will notify you. It will help you to avoid casual purchases: the application can really save your money.\r\n\r\nINSTANT ADD\r\nAdd your new cosmetics in a few seconds or add all the information about the new product to get the most comprehensive statistics. You can also write down your impressions about the usage of the item and attach a photo or an image from your smartphone to it.\r\n\r\n\r\nPROJECT PAN\r\nBeautistics is a very useful app for every Project Pan enthusiast. It\u2019s easy to track your progress: just add items from the collection and take photos from time to time. Beautistics will save all the photos of each product, so you can create collages from it and share instantly. Every item can be moved to Project Pan archive, and it\u2019s possible to restore it back.\r\n\r\nADVANCED BEAUTY STATISTICS IN YOUR PHONE\r\nBeautistics will collect and show you the statistics about your collection: prices and spending, amount of bought and finished products during different time periods, it will also show you the most crowded categories of your collection. \r\n\r\nCOLLECTION BACKUP\r\nBeautistics will create a backup of the collection. Be sure your data won\u2019t be lost when you change your device\r\n\r\nHANDY BEAUTY CALENDAR\r\nBeauty calendar is a feature that will suit ideally to organize your routine. It will remind you about your planned procedures at home or in a beauty salon, it will also create your individual plan for using care products. \r\n\r\nSEARCH AND FILTER\r\nThe application \u201cknows\u201d more than thousand brands that helps to create new products. You can easily navigate through huge collections with help of filters and search by title, brand or type.\r\n\r\nWISH LIST\r\nYou can save all the products you want to buy in future to the Wish List tab. It\u2019s possible to add a photo or any other picture of the desired product, and you can get its title from any text on your smartphone: just select it and use \u201cshare\u201d menu.\r\n\r\nYou can add up to 20 items for free and check if Beautistics is what you need. Get a subscription or a lifetime, and use all the features without restrictions. \r\n\r\nBeautistics doesn\u2019t use your personal data.\r\nWe guarantee an attentive attitude to your wishes and recommendations. \r\n\r\nContacts:\r\nadmin@beautistics.com\r\nCzech Republic\r\nMost 434 01 \r\nt\u0159. Budovatel\u016f 2392/88 \u010d. 34",
    "descriptionHTML": "The best beauty app to order and track your collection, better than any spreadsheet.<br><br>Beautistics is a nice and handy application created for you not only to track the expiration dates, your Project Pan progress, but to become your personal beauty manager. Your makeup, care products, perfume, all your collection is near at hand. The application remembers prices and other useful statistics, it helps to follow your budgets and saves your future purchases in a wish list. You\u2019ll be able to organize a routine with help of a smart beauty calendar: the application will remind you of planned procedures. It\u2019s only a part of all the Beautistics\u2019 features! <br><br>Features:<br><br>\u2022\tSmart suggestions to add your items quickly<br>\u2022\tMakeup expiration dates<br>\u2022\tBudget planning<br>\u2022\tInventory statistics and usages<br>\u2022\tAdvanced beauty statistics in your phone<br>\u2022\tSmart reminders<br>\u2022\tProject Pan special features<br>\u2022\tCollection backup<br>\u2022\tHandy beauty calendar<br>\u2022\tOrganize the makeup bag by brands and types<br>\u2022\tCreate a personal wish list<br><br><br>COSMETICS EXPIRATION DATES<br>There is no need to remember the dates of opening packages and cosmetics expiration dates. Beautistics will do it for you. It\u2019s enough to allow notifications, and the application will notify you about the products that are expiring soon or already expired<br><br>BUDGET PLANNING <br>Plan your purchases with a help of Beautistics&#39; special function. You can set your monthly, quarterly and yearly budget. If you are close to that limits or reach it, Beautistics will notify you. It will help you to avoid casual purchases: the application can really save your money.<br><br>INSTANT ADD<br>Add your new cosmetics in a few seconds or add all the information about the new product to get the most comprehensive statistics. You can also write down your impressions about the usage of the item and attach a photo or an image from your smartphone to it.<br><br><br>PROJECT PAN<br>Beautistics is a very useful app for every Project Pan enthusiast. It\u2019s easy to track your progress: just add items from the collection and take photos from time to time. Beautistics will save all the photos of each product, so you can create collages from it and share instantly. Every item can be moved to Project Pan archive, and it\u2019s possible to restore it back.<br><br>ADVANCED BEAUTY STATISTICS IN YOUR PHONE<br>Beautistics will collect and show you the statistics about your collection: prices and spending, amount of bought and finished products during different time periods, it will also show you the most crowded categories of your collection. <br><br>COLLECTION BACKUP<br>Beautistics will create a backup of the collection. Be sure your data won\u2019t be lost when you change your device<br><br>HANDY BEAUTY CALENDAR<br>Beauty calendar is a feature that will suit ideally to organize your routine. It will remind you about your planned procedures at home or in a beauty salon, it will also create your individual plan for using care products. <br><br>SEARCH AND FILTER<br>The application \u201cknows\u201d more than thousand brands that helps to create new products. You can easily navigate through huge collections with help of filters and search by title, brand or type.<br><br>WISH LIST<br>You can save all the products you want to buy in future to the Wish List tab. It\u2019s possible to add a photo or any other picture of the desired product, and you can get its title from any text on your smartphone: just select it and use \u201cshare\u201d menu.<br><br>You can add up to 20 items for free and check if Beautistics is what you need. Get a subscription or a lifetime, and use all the features without restrictions. <br><br>Beautistics doesn\u2019t use your personal data.<br>We guarantee an attentive attitude to your wishes and recommendations. <br><br>Contacts:<br>admin@beautistics.com<br>Czech Republic<br>Most 434 01 <br>t\u0159. Budovatel\u016f 2392/88 \u010d. 34",
